  (text "Note: USB-PD sink (CH224A, 32 V-tolerant), requests 9 V via R3=6.8k; 24k = 12 V." (at 32.8 129.19 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid 0eadcc12-e48d-4739-a5e1-9364fae32c7c))
  (text "Note: 9 V request. Use 24k (C25769) for 12 V. NEVER leave open (=20 V)." (at 32.8 174.91 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid 3f1a33e9-1cd8-4c14-b6f7-b09f55d64524))
  (text "Note: Solder pads to share one USB-C supply between 2-3 boards" (at 32.8 270.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid 07fc365a-244f-41d3-a2fc-4eb244ffb992))
  (text "Note: Both H-bridges paralleled (A||B) for 2.4 A avg" (at 202.98 107.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid c41afcea-d812-4bd8-ba6a-86263ab4d5b3))
  (text "Note: Keeps driver in standby while ESP boots" (at 202.98 200.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid 916700cf-5fd1-4766-ac31-8aa4fc063cfb))
  (text "Note: Hand-soldered (through-hole), supplied by you" (at 291.88 66.96000000000001 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid fcb0e252-b425-41ab-a57e-edfd5f67394f))
  (text "Note: Keeps wiper max ~3.0 V, inside the ADC's linear range" (at 291.88 91.09 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid 2d46d105-e4e8-4a87-9a40-99f02cd5c77a))
  (text "Note: Series ESD resistor on the touch line" (at 291.88 159.67000000000002 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid 3f3e7c06-b6be-4f6d-927a-30608723194b))
  (text "Note: Antenna overhangs the fader end" (at 385.86 138.07999999999998 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0) italic) (justify left)) (uuid aefc1735-e844-48ad-a4aa-3b8769ccd3fc))
